        <mxCell id="175" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;align=left;verticalAlign=top;size=14;" value="FINDING B1 (Med). The Geh step sends a WhatsApp Flow with NO buttons/sections. The /chat simulator (addChips) renders only buttons+sections, never &#39;flow&#39;. A human testing via /chat sees the prompt with no selectable option and must know to TYPE &#39;Havan&#39;. README still claims /chat &#39;drives the full booking flow&#39;. Drift." vertex="1">
